# Minimal build context: never send root secrets or unrelated workspaces.
**
!.ci/
!.ci/apps.json
!side-projects/
!side-projects/admin-notifications/
!side-projects/admin-notifications/**
**/node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/
**/dist/**
**/coverage/
**/coverage/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/*.p12
**/.git/
**/.git/**
